[[0,1128353,0,31,0,31,"2016-06-23T07:27:42","SkillYourself","",[],"","Oculus Claims its Exclusivity Deals Are \"Good For The Industry\" | The Escapist","http://www.escapistmagazine.com/news/view/167789-Oculus-Claims-Exclusives-Are-Good-For-Industry","gaming"],[1,5596420,0,25,1,24,"2016-06-23T07:28:35","SkillYourself","",[],"<p>Dear Oculus, </p>\n<p>I sincerely hope your platform dies.</p>\n<p>Regards,</p>\n<p>Me.</p>"],[2,5597334,5596420,2,0,2,"2016-06-23T12:02:29","Vladar","",[],"<p>s/Oculus/Facebook/</p>"],[2,5598059,5596420,1,0,1,"2016-06-23T13:53:49","Totenglocke","",[],"<p>I'm just looking forward to VR fad 2.0 to die entirely. Then in five years or so, we'll get Motion Control fad 3.0...</p>"],[1,5596616,0,6,0,6,"2016-06-23T08:49:12","profanion","",[],"<p>We all know how country exclusive deals are harmful to both television companies and to consumers and why should I believe it's different from video game exclusives?</p>"],[1,5597309,0,1,0,1,"2016-06-23T11:58:29","ArsCortica","",[],"<p>Surely, it must be at least as &quot;good for the industry&quot; as OR selling out to Facebook.</p>"],[1,5597444,0,0,0,0,"2016-06-23T12:21:23","Troll","",[],"<p>I think VR will be a niche market. For all the marketing hype and all the companies hailing it as the best thing ever, it's still going to be a niche market. And in that niche market Oculus is going to bomb.</p>"],[2,5597473,5597444,0,0,0,"2016-06-23T12:25:47","SkillYourself","",[],"<p>I think it has potential, given a couple of years to refine.</p>"],[3,5598256,5597473,1,0,1,"2016-06-23T14:26:11","thrus","",[],"<p>That is the catch it needs time to mature and to bring the price down. As is, it is priced like a PC or console but needs one of those as well to run it. Until you can do a decent VR setup for around $700 total it is going to be stuck as a niche market. Even if the VR side was at $200 it would be in the same category as the Steering wheels and pedal together setups for gaming.</p>"],[1,5598773,0,0,0,0,"2016-06-23T15:27:56","Plavonica","",[],"<p>Stop trying to bring the console wars to PC you fucks.</p>"],[1,5604052,0,0,0,0,"2016-06-24T00:36:00","NedTaggart","",[],"<p>I'm sooooo glad I went with the Vive. </p>"]]
