[[0,1128365,0,16,4,12,"2016-06-23T07:39:37","POlka","",[],"","An Introduction to The Suicide Squad - Will Jared Leto be the better Joker ? ","http://www.casinoreviews.co.uk/introduction-suicide-squad/","movies"],[1,5596469,0,3,1,2,"2016-06-23T07:41:34","POlka","",[],"<p>What do you Guys think, can Jared Leto fill the shoes of Heath Ledger ?</p>"],[2,5597430,5596469,2,1,1,"2016-06-23T12:19:34","BigMe","[e]",[],"<p>That could totaly be cool!</p>"],[2,5599208,5596469,5,0,5,"2016-06-23T16:16:15","barset","",[],"<p>Probably not. The guy is one of the most skilled actors out there, but the production company he's working for doesn't seem to get the material. I'm all for a fresh take, but making the Joker a thug4lyfe doesn't match up.</p>\n<p>I think it might work if they pull a Jason Todd though. I'm really hoping for a Jason Todd. </p>"],[2,5607984,5596469,0,0,0,"2016-06-24T12:08:19","DelusionalHominids","",[],"<p>nope</p>"],[2,5633920,5596469,0,0,0,"2016-06-27T11:25:56","gentlemanadventurer","",[],"<p>No. The Joker died with Heath. </p>"],[1,5597786,0,1,1,0,"2016-06-23T13:15:55","svend10","",[],"<p>That would be great xD</p>"],[1,5597811,0,1,1,0,"2016-06-23T13:18:05","madridlove1","",[],"<p>I personall dont hope for that!&quot;!!</p>"],[1,5599068,0,3,0,3,"2016-06-23T16:01:25","BigFatDaddy","",[],"<p>No, he won't. The look is already all wrong.</p>"],[2,5608089,5599068,1,0,1,"2016-06-24T12:33:49","Totenglocke","",[],"<p>Yup, the ghetto look is terrible and he gives off a major gay vibe as well. </p>"],[1,5599494,0,3,1,2,"2016-06-23T16:45:36","vandilx","",[],"<p>The 60s Batman TV Show Joker was campy and fun.</p>\n<p>Jack Nicholson's joker was uniquely dark and fun. Very different from the TV Show Joker and was still great.</p>\n<p>Heath Ledger's joker was haunting and crazy. Very different from Nicholson and was great.</p>\n<p>Let's let Jared Leto be his own joker. I'm sure it will be different and still great.</p>"],[1,5600208,0,3,0,3,"2016-06-23T18:01:06","Hate-Sponge","",[],"<p>This Joker has a tattoo on his head that says &quot;Damage&quot; and wears a grill. There trying really hard to make this Joker edgy and cool but it ends up as a shit.</p>"],[2,5600807,5600208,0,0,0,"2016-06-23T19:01:02","Frank_Barone","",[],"<p>not defending the look, but i read they were trying to emulate the mexican cartel, who have lots of tatoos and wear flashy clothes.he sort of looks like early janes addiction perry farrell to me</p>"],[3,5601235,5600807,3,0,3,"2016-06-23T19:43:37","Hate-Sponge","",[],"<p>They went for Machete and got Blink 182</p>"],[4,5618073,5601235,0,0,0,"2016-06-25T15:52:43","Totenglocke","",[],"<p>He asked for a 13, but they drew a 31!</p>"],[5,5619929,5618073,0,0,0,"2016-06-25T19:43:24","Hate-Sponge","",[],"<p>Thats an Offspring song not Blink 182</p>"],[2,5659072,5600208,0,0,0,"2016-06-29T23:21:44","BPrime","",[],"<p>Well this Joker is actually Robin who was tortured and destroyed by the original Joker, which included getting his teeth knocked out. So I guess the grills make a little sense there.</p>"],[3,5659465,5659072,0,0,0,"2016-06-30T00:08:09","Hate-Sponge","",[],"<p>Is this canon that DC themselves said or fan &quot;canon&quot; were fans use an excuse to explain bullshit.</p>"],[4,5659495,5659465,0,0,0,"2016-06-30T00:11:02","BPrime","",[],"<p>Happened in the comics. Most likely not gonna be the case for the movie. Probably just has a grill cause hes a little bitch.</p>"],[5,5659525,5659495,0,0,0,"2016-06-30T00:13:57","Hate-Sponge","",[],"<p>I remember the Joker killing Jason Todd but he never became the joker</p>"],[6,5659572,5659525,0,0,0,"2016-06-30T00:19:19","BPrime","",[],"<p>Let me get back to you with some sources.</p>"],[1,5606882,0,0,0,0,"2016-06-24T05:43:47","POlka","",[],"<p>Can anyone shed some light on what role Batman will play in the storyline?</p>\n<p>I read that the movie is supposed to loosely follow this Storyline <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Batman:_Assault_on_Arkham\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Batman:_Assault_on_Arkham</a>\r\nThis would imply that the Riddler is the main villian no ?</p>"]]
